用一个计时器表示当前窗口，期间每次调用只替换待处理的接收者和参数。到期先释放计时器，再取走最后一组参数执行。下例是仅尾沿版本，适合需要处理最后一次输入的固定窗口采样。

```js
function trailingThrottle(fn, delay) {
  let timer
  let pending
  return function (...args) {
    pending = [this, args]
    if (timer !== undefined) return
    timer = setTimeout(() => {
      const [receiver, latest] = pending
      timer = undefined
      pending = undefined
      fn.apply(receiver, latest)
    }, delay)
  }
}
```
